    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102420/extras/8c5397c5407ce06404cf8de9995a675e.avif?t=1685355650\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hiders</strong></h2>Sneak, hide, build traps, fly on the broomstick, resurrect friends, make fun of the seeker. Decide for yourself whether you will do it yourself or cooperate with others to outsmart the villain<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102420/extras/313feeeef1964b5d74768788b6b97276.avif?t=1685355650\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Online Coop</strong></h2>Take part in exciting crazy 10 vs 1 gameplay. Have fun with your friends or find a new one in game. Cooperate with others or play alone. Troll the seeker and support your teammates as a ghost<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102420/extras/9fc1feb0514d9bbb6d791dbfdba42e82.avif?t=1685355650\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Seeker</strong></h2>Choose your seeker with unique skills and hunt down all the hiders in your favorite style. Eliminate others or scare them out - time is in your favor<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102420/extras/ed3f2609b03953fb4ea916108400adf1.avif?t=1685355650\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lots of outfits</strong></h2>Change the appearance of your character to make it unique like you. No matter if you are seeker or hider - feel this style !",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102420/extras/8c5397c5407ce06404cf8de9995a675e.avif?t=1685355650\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hiders</strong></h2>Sneak, hide, build traps, fly on the broomstick, resurrect friends, make fun of the seeker. Decide for yourself whether you will do it yourself or cooperate with others to outsmart the villain<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102420/extras/313feeeef1964b5d74768788b6b97276.avif?t=1685355650\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Online Coop</strong></h2>Take part in exciting crazy 10 vs 1 gameplay. Have fun with your friends or find a new one in game. Cooperate with others or play alone. Troll the seeker and support your teammates as a ghost<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102420/extras/9fc1feb0514d9bbb6d791dbfdba42e82.avif?t=1685355650\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Seeker</strong></h2>Choose your seeker with unique skills and hunt down all the hiders in your favorite style. Eliminate others or scare them out - time is in your favor<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102420/extras/ed3f2609b03953fb4ea916108400adf1.avif?t=1685355650\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lots of outfits</strong></h2>Change the appearance of your character to make it unique like you. No matter if you are seeker or hider - feel this style !",
    "short_description": "Spooked is a crazy hide &amp; seek game in a huge magical castle with up to 10 hiders playing against one dangerous seeker. Maybe you will be sneaky enough to complete all the tasks and get out of the mysterious castle or enough determined to hunt everyone else down",
